,"kind":"announcement","title":"Tianxia Bachang's Sinkhole Outlaw Chase Global Launch on Steam Nov 24","summary":"Fans of mystery and adventure stories, the opening time of the sinkhole entrance is set.Today, with Zhejiang Radio & Television Huazhi Digital Media as lead investor and controlling producer, co-produced by Xiaoying Interactive Entertainment, Caidingge Game Studio, Hebei Radio & Television Wireless Media, and Huayu Network, and distributed by Yixiangfeng Interactive Entertainment, the officially authorized interactive game Sinkhole Outlaw Chase has officially announced its release date: the game","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:18:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038698","verified_at":"2026-10-24T05:47:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4498140-1846651706694297","game_id":"steam-4498140","kind":"update","title":"Sinkhole Outlaw Chase Demo Update Notes — October 20","summary":"Dear Explorers,We've just pushed a new build. Here's what's changed:Updated a set of video assets to fix frame drops in certain videos during playback.Fixed an issue where Takagi and Kobayashi's character files could not be opened.Fixed an issue where the mouse cursor disappeared when browsing character files.Fixed some mouse click light effect styles.Corrected several text display issues.Thank you to every explorer who shared feedback—we've read it all carefully. We look forward to hearing more","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T08:53:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4498140-1846651706689552","game_id":"steam-4498140","kind":"announcement","title":"Tianxia Bachang's Sinkhole Outlaw Chase debuts at Steam Next Fest. Demo out now!","summary":"Sinkhole Outlaw Chase, the first live-action interactive game officially authorized by Tianxia Bachang, is officially joining the Steam Next Fest, with the Demo now available for download today.Adapted from Tianxia Bachang's original novel of the same name, the story is set in 1954 in the Laoyeling mountains of Northeast China. A Sino-foreign scientific expedition ventures into the mountains for exploration and falls into a hidden sinkhole, after which the entire team goes missing. You play as r","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:07:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689552","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4498140-1840944183783526","game_id":"steam-4498140","kind":"announcement","title":"\"Sinkhole Outlaw Chase\" Steam Wishlist Campaign (Phase 1)","summary":"\"Hidden Treasure of the Sinkhole\" Steam Wishlist Now Open!🏔️ Join us on this adventure across mountains and passes, reverse your fate, and claim exclusive gifts~🎯 Game Overview The first interactive suspense adventure movie‑game based on the IP of Tianxia Bachang. Cross mountains and passes—fate can be reversed! Deep in the Laoyeling Mountains of Northeast China, a Sino‑foreign scientific expedition team ventures into the primeval forest for a survey mission. After accidentally falling into a hi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T08:18:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183783526","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4498140-1840310314340651","game_id":"steam-4498140","kind":"announcement","title":"Cross mountains, reverse fate! Tianxia Bachang's Sinkhole Outlaw Chase debuts.","summary":"Fans of mystery and adventure stories can finally step into the game and take control of the narrative themselves!Presented by Zhejiang Radio & Television Huazhi Digital Media, co-produced by Xiaoying Interactive Entertainment, Caidingge Game Studio, Hebei Radio & Television Wireless Media, and Huayu Network, and distributed by Yixiangfeng Interactive Entertainment Studio, the first interactive live-action game of the Tianxia Bachang IP, Sinkhole Outlaw Chase, is now officially live on Steam! Un","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T02:32:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340651","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4498140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:01Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4498140":"2026-10-26T12:32:01Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4498140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:00Z"},"4508040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:01Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:01Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:32:01Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4498140","app_id":4498140,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1cc9e6b0f1674bbfb238e7c98eb58c9c40965bc6f67aee6ba60d427cda0e52f1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A scie